{"hw":"ἄλογος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἄλογος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἄλογος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">without</b> <span class=\"gk\">λόγος,</span> hence, </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">I</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">speechless,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">696e</span> </span>. <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-ως</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">without speech,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OC</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">131</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.9</span> </span>:—<span class=\"gk\">ἄ. ἡμέρα,</span> <abbr>=</abbr> Lat. <b class=\"lex-tr\">dies nefastus, on which no business may be done,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lex.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">b</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">lacking in eloquence,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">LXX</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ex.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.12</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">inexpressive,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">203a</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">unutterable,</b> = ἄρρητος, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">262</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">unreasoning,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἡδονή, ὄχλος,</span> etc., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">591c</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ti.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">42d</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">τὰ ἄλογα</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">brutes, animals,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Democr.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">164</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">321b</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hier.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.3</span> </span>; esp.in late Greek, <span class=\"gk\">ἄλογον, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τό</span>,</span> <abbr>=</abbr> <b class=\"lex-tr\">horse,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">POxy.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">138.29</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">610</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.D.</span> </span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PGen.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14</span> </span> (late). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">not according to reason, irrational,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἄ. δόξα,</span> opp. <span class=\"gk\">ἡ μετὰ λόγου δ.,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">201c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀλόγῳ πάθει τὴν ἄ. συν